OL,3,GNEWSAMother backs calls to stop
OL,4,Akillers' early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of Nottingham attacks victim
OL,7,FBarnaby Webber has backed calls to stop
OL,8,Fkillers convicted of any form of
OL,9,Fmanslaughter being released early from
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FBarnaby, his friend Grace
OL,13,FO'Malley-Kumar and school caretaker Ian
OL,14,FCoates were killed on 13 June 2023 by
OL,15,FValdo Calocane, who pleaded guilty to
OL,16,Fmanslaughter on the grounds of
OL,17,Fdiminished responsibility, and was
OL,18,Fsentenced to a hospital order.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
