OL,3,GNEWSAMother backs calls to stop
OL,4,Akillers' early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Webber has now joined more than 30
OL,7,Ffamilies - including BBC commentator,
OL,8,FJohn Hunt, whose wife and two daughters
OL,9,Fwere murdered in a crossbow attack - in
OL,10,Fsigning an open letter to the
OL,11,Fgovernment.
OL,13,FThe government said it was
OL,14,Ffast-tracking a plan to keep the most
OL,15,Fdangerous offenders behind bars.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
